        "created_at": "2016-11-22T14:59:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It also sucks against The Dreamer. Well, not really; but you gotta change Jackhandle out for Dual Crowbars and you're back in business.</p><p>And I tested this out vs. Voss, I just fished for Grease Monkey Fist asap. Done and done! Suddenly he's dealing nothing but, idunno, Sonic leg-sweeps. It worked out great.</p><p>And yes, I have loved using Overdrive after using Micro-Assembler. Another fun Micro-Assembler prank: give it to Legacy! Use it to fish out The Legacy Ring! Now you can use a second power! Boom.</p>",
