        "created_at": "2016-11-23T13:46:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I definitely have Grease Monkey Fist as my first priority versus Voss well before, I hope, a Flagship comes out; same with things like Twist the Ether if I'm NOT just playing Broken AOE Squad. Mostly because of his minions coming in&nbsp;with different immunities; it's important to diversify!</p>",
